Hobnail McZortch wrote:
>
> I'm playing my first healer, and noticed that I have no spell skills
> outside the healing school. If I receive a non-healing spellbook through
> prayer, will that skill slot open up so that I can get to Basic, the same
> way as if I'd received an artifact weapon?

This is one way spells and weapons are different.  Your character
starts with a list of spell skills and that's it.  You can still
*learn* other spells, and you can still *cast* them, you just
can't increase your skill in them.

Per the prayer spoiler the game tries (level+1) times to give you a
book you don't know then gives up and gives you a random book.  Per
the spellbook spoiler it's actually (a book you don't know that is
also in one of your schools).  So at first you'll receive spells you
can use the best but at some point those will run out and you'll get
mostly books you don't know and then at some other point you'll
receive random ones.  Compare the maximum level of 30 with the
number of possible spellbooks and it's possible to go through a game
never receiving all types of spellbooks.

